OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry through
OL,6,Fthe evening with some clear spells in
OL,7,Fthe east but cloudier over the west.
OL,8,FIt will stay dry overnight with some
OL,9,Ffrost in places again.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA chilly but largely sunny
OL,12,Fmorning inland, rather cloudy over the
OL,13,FWestern Isles. Clouding over from the
OL,14,Fsoutheast through the afternoon,
OL,15,Fstaying bright in the northwest until
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
